OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FOften cloudy with scattered
OL,6,Fshowers, these possibly heavy at times
OL,7,Fand also merging into long spells of
OL,8,Frain across eastern areas later this
OL,9,Fafternoon. Feeling cool. Becoming
OL,10,Fwindy along the coast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRather cloudy overnight with
OL,13,Foutbreaks of rain or showers, some of
OL,14,Fwhich could be heavy at times. Likely
OL,15,Fbecoming drier towards the south and
OL,16,Fwest of the region by dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
