OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FA cloudy start and mostly dry,
OL,6,Falbeit for some light rain at first
OL,7,Ffor the northeast of the region. Cloud
OL,8,Ftending to break with some sunny
OL,9,Fspells by the afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FOften
OL,12,Fcloudy with a chance of occasional
OL,13,Frain or showers on Tuesday and
OL,14,FWednesday, but also some drier
OL,15,Fperiods, especially later on Thursday.
OL,16,FTemperatures generally near normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
